# Feed-signing identity — SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH (F2, feeds.culvertlabs.com).
#
# The public SaaS URL-category feed has its OWN keyless signing identity, DISTINCT
# from the release-catalog identity in release_identity.env: a dedicated signing
# workflow (publish-feeds.yml) and a dedicated tag namespace (feeds-v*). Both
# verify surfaces consume these values so the feed CI signing/verify workflow
# (cosign) and the in-binary feed verifier (Go, urlcatfeed.Official* constants in
# internal/urlcatfeed/identity.go) can never drift:
#   - CI sources this file for `cosign` identity flags (feed sign/verify).
#   - feeds_identity_ssot_test.go asserts these EXACTLY equal the Go constants.
#
# PUBLIC identity policy only — issuer + SAN regex (RE2). No secrets.
# Renaming publish-feeds.yml needs a coordinated update here + the Go constant +
# an overlap window (same lifecycle discipline as the catalog identity).
CULVERT_FEED_SIGSTORE_ISSUER=https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com
CULVERT_FEED_SIGSTORE_SAN_REGEX=^https://github\.com/KidCarmi/Culvert/\.github/workflows/publish-feeds\.yml@refs/tags/feeds-v.*$
